---
const quotes = [
  { quote: "无限进步。", author: "影视飓风" },
  { quote: "保持饥饿，保持愚蠢。", author: "史蒂夫·乔布斯" },
  { quote: "达人所之未达，探人所之未知。", author: "徐霞客" },
  { quote: "勇踏前人未至之境。", author: "《星际迷航》" },
  { quote: "生命不息，折腾不止。", author: "罗永浩" },
  { quote: "人类的特别之处，在于对未知的狂热。", author: "赫拉利" },
  { quote: "我没有特别的天赋，只是极其好奇。", author: "阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦" },
];
---

<section class="hero animate-fade-in">
  <div class="status-wrap animate-fade-in delay-1">
    <div class="badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      <span>探索全栈 · 前端架构 · 交互美学</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero-title animate-fade-in delay-2">
    构建快速、精致且有<br />
    <span class="text-gradient">温度的数字体验</span>。
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-desc animate-fade-in delay-3">
    嗨，我是 <strong>Aaron</strong>。专注于现代 Web 架构、交互细节与高效开发流。
    追求极简设计与极致性能，坚持 Astro 零运行时 JS 倾向。
  </p>

  <div class="hero-actions animate-fade-in delay-4">
    <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-primary">
      浏览项目作品
      <svg
        width="16"
        height="16"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2.2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
        <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a href="/posts" class="btn btn-secondary">阅读文章</a>
  </div>

  <div class="stack-pills animate-fade-in delay-4">
    <span class="pill-label">技术栈：</span>
    <span class="pill">React</span>
    <span class="pill">Vue 3</span>
    <span class="pill">TypeScript</span>
    <span class="pill">Astro</span>
    <span class="pill">Modern CSS</span>
    <span class="pill">pnpm monorepo</span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .status-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5.5vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .hero-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .stack-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .pill-label {
    margin-right: 0.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pill {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-medium);
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.06);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      width: 100%;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .hero-actions .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
